source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: The escape does stop the heading, but Jira shows the backslash, so `h1\.` is not how line control is protected.
-- input.jira --
h1\. x
-- rendered.html --
<p>h1\. x</p>
-- want.md --
h1\\. x
-- warnings.json --
[]
